Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等你很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah! Oh, my God! Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉抱歉  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry! I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在睡午觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从何时开始 用那种怪姿势睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since when do you take naps in that position?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你是在等男人吧  拜托你说是在等男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh God Monica, tell me you were waiting for a guy! Please tell me you were waiting for a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我在  等男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I was. A guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅同事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近跟同事约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm seeing a guy from work! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个长得像雷李欧塔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That cute waiter guy from your restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲切版帅哥服务生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The one that looks like a non-threatening Ray Liotta?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aha. That one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就闪人  我只是回来拿件外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what, just give me a second and I'll be out of your hair. I'm just going to grab a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:01:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我回来  可要告诉我详情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I get back, I want every little detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, um... Okay, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是乔伊跟罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just Joey and Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是去看电影吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why aren't you at the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  可是罗斯打电话太吵  被电影院轰出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were, but Ross was talking so loud on his phone, they threw us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电影太吵  我当然得大声讲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to talk loud because the movie was loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他打电话去伦敦  天啊  找到艾蜜莉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's talking to London. My God.Did he get in touch with Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没  他打给女方所有的亲戚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well no, not yet. He's calling everyone on her side of the family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望有人愿意帮他联络艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...hoping someone will help him get in touch with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算我说错名字又怎样  你这大惊小怪的笨蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care if I said some other girl's name, you prissy old twit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给人家拍马屁拍得可真好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Way to suck up to the family!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴大家都在  公司终于买到防皱传真纸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad you guys are all here! My office finally got wrinkle-free fax paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第04集  菲比讨厌PBS（美国广播公司）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E04  The One Where Phoebe Hates PBS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别过来  那是呕吐西装\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Oh, no, no! Vomit tux! No, no! Vomit tux!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我干洗过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, I had it dry-cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呕吐西装\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vomit tux?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会吐在...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who vomited on...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  乔伊  你为何穿成这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? What you up to, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要上马拉松式电视节目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're doing this telethon thing on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的经纪人帮我争取当主持人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And my agent got me a job as co-host!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮公视做好事  又能增加曝光率\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little good deed for PBS, plus some TV exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我乔伊最爱做这种美事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the kind of math Joey likes to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公视啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, PBS!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公视哪里不对了  他们哪里对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong with PBS? What's right with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为何不喜欢公视\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you like PBS?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我妈自杀之后  我孤苦伶仃非常难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, 'cause right after my mom killed herself,I was just in this really bad place, you know, personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想写信给《芝麻街》  心情应该会好一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I just thought it would make me feel better if I wrote to Sesame Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我小时候  总觉得他们很亲切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because they were so nice when I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果根本没人回信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one ever wrote back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些布偶根本没有手指  写不了信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well y'know a lot of those Muppets don't have thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只收到一个烂钥匙环  拜托  我那时住在纸箱里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I got was a lousy key chain! And by that time I was living in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连钥匙都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't have keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾  菲比  我只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, Pheebs.I just wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想做好事  就像你帮忙生小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}do a good deed, like you did with the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才不是做善事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't a good deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是想上电视  根本就很自私\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just want to get on TV. This is totally selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮弟弟生小孩又怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about you having those babies for your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自私的不是只有我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Talk about selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你胡说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的确是帮忙他们  不过自己心情也很好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, it was a really nice thing and all, but it made you feel really good right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你做善事心情好  也算是自私的一种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It made you feel good so that makes it selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上根本就没有无私的好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, there's no unselfish good deeds. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明明就有  有很多行善的人都没有私心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, there are totally good deeds that are selfless!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你举出一个例子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May I ask for one example?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是有  例如\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's... You know, there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you may not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为所有人都很自私\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's because all people are selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说我自私\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you calling me selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不是人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you calling you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  很抱歉戳破你的美梦  世界上没有无私的善事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry to burst that bubble, Pheebs, but selfless good deeds don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道圣诞老人吧  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know the deal on Santa Claus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会找到一件无私的善事  打败你这个  邪恶博士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna find a selfless good deed. I'm going to beat you, you evil genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  罗斯吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Hello, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   是艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Oh my God, It's Emily!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  是艾蜜莉  别吵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Emily, everyone! Shh! Shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我打来只是要告诉你  别再骚扰我家人了  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I'm only ringing to say stop harassing my relatives. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  就算你挂断  我也会继续打  如果要打给所有英国人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait! Okay,Okay, you can hang up, but I'm gonna keep calling! I'm gonna, I'm gonna call everyone in England
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才能逼你跟我说话  我也办得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if that's what it takes to get you to talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你想谈什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我太太  我们已经结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, you're my wife. We're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我认为如此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, at least I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯跟我说话了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  你刚刚  为何提到圣诞老人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey, When you said "the deal with Santa Claus," you meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有这号人物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That he doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你听说  摩妮卡的地下情人了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Chandler, have you heard about Monica's secret boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:06:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道  她...她是提过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh, yeah. She uh, she uh, she might have mentioned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底何时  才能认识这个服务生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Mon, when are we going to meet this new, secret waiter man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很害羞  我想现在还没准备  认识大家吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's really shy. I don't think he's up to meeting everyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他还没准备好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I don't think he's up to meeting everyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  我想见他  她说他床上功夫一级棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care, I wanna meet this guy who's the best sex she ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有这样的评论  你说过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what you heard? You said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I might have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这有什么好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我为他高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I'm very happy for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是  走狗运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you! You lucky dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉愿意跟我破镜重圆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Emily's willing to work on the relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在伦敦啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她要我搬到伦敦去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? She wants me to move to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这是废话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What-what-what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要跟卡萝  苏珊谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet if I talked to Carol and Susan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定能说服她们带小班搬到伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I could convince them to move to London with Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想必你前妻一定乐意搬到国外去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure your ex-wife would be more than happy to move to another country...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮你挽回新太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so you can patch things up with your new wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是不可能啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  欢迎  幸会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing? Welcome. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This'll be your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过应该没有人会打来找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm not really expecting a lot of calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你负责接电话接受捐款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you answer it and take pledges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是主持人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  盖瑞卡林才是主持人  你负责接电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Gary Collins is the host. You'll be answering the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你恐怕搞不清楚状况  我是雷莫瑞医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't seem to understand. See, I was Dr. Drake Ramoray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你负责这支电话  医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, here's your phone, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我竟然找不到一件无私的善行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I can't find a selfless good deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前我家隔壁有个老头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know that really old guy that lives next door to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偷溜到他家  帮他打扫前廊的落叶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I snuck over there and raked up all the leaves on his front stoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他捉到我之后  强迫我喝西打  吃饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But he caught me, and he force-fed me cider and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我却很开心  那个呆子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I felt wonderful. That old jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许乔伊说得对  所有好事的出发点都有私心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe Joey's right. Maybe all good deeds are selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要找到一件无私的善行  毕竟我才刚生出三个宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will find a selfless good deed. Because I just gave birth to three children...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能让他们在  乔伊认为有理的世界里长大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I will not let them be raised in a world where Joey's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  可以问你有关烹饪的问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Monica? Can I ask you a cooking question?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  如果你用炉子烹饪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. If you're cooking on the stove...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是否代表你新的地下男友在床上  比理查还厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...does that mean that your new secret boyfriend is better in bed than Richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要尊重秘密新男友的隐私\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, y'know I think I'm going to respect the privacy of my new, secret boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean If this guy was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又知道  自己是你碰过最棒的情人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's me who'd learned that it was me who was the best you'd ever had...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会手舞足蹈的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'd be going like this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As much as I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不能丢下小班去伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm sorry, I can't move to London without Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很为难你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand that would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你考虑搬过来好吗   你本来就打算搬来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you please consider moving here? I mean You were moving here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何不现在就来呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why can't you just do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我知道自己到目前为止  表现都这样白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, but I know that even though I've been a complete idiot up till now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你还是应该过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you have to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来嘛  我们才能继续走下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to, so we can work this out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你刚说 "好吧"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right? Did you just say "all right"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  现在换我是白痴了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did. Now I'm the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily, that is so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会很棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就像坠入爱河的一对白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to be like two idiots in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  有件是还是让我很担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, there's one thing that really scares me still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你尽管说  你要知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, tell me. You have to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当天婚礼我在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...how humiliating it was for me up on that altar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲朋好友面前有多丢脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in front of my entire family, all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我非常抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我决定原谅你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then, after deciding to forgive you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却看到你跟她赶着上飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...seeing you at the airport, catching our plane with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Again, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本无法与她共处一室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I can't be in the same room as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我光想到你跟她共处一室  就快气坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It drives me mad thinking of you being in the same room as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉  我跟瑞秋根本没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily, there is nothing between Rachel and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱的是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去纽约  我们再试试看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll come to New York and we'll try to make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你答应不再见瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As long as you don't see Rachel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就问艾蜜莉愿不愿意来纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I asked Emily if she would come to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她答应了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! Ooh-ohh! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,条件是我不准再见瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Only if I promise never to see Rachel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  那怎么行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说在考虑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told her I'd have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底该怎么决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, how the hell am I supposed to make this kind of a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这是在问你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm actually asking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能就此不见瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you can't just not see Rachel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你的好朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's one of your best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他也不能不见艾蜜莉  她是他老婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But he can't not see Emily, I mean that's his wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's true! Yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟瑞秋从高中就认识  不能说不见就不见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you've known Rachel since high school and you cannot just cut her out of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得也对  的确不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's true! No, you cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们的帮忙  问题一点也没解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for the help. Problem solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.62,0:11:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Hey, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我们看了一整天电视  你到底何时才会出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Joey. We've been watching all day. When are you gonna be on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我经纪人搞错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, There was kind of a mix-up in my agent's office...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我上了电视   就有曝光率\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I'm still on TV, and that's good exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没上电视啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  现在呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. How about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了  看到他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! There he is! There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是这里有整只鸭  不过管他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now maybe just put the whole duck right in there. Who cares? y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先处理鸭腿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now I got the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过多少次  不准看烹饪频道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How many times have I told you guys to never watch the cooking channel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  钱德  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Chandler. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.87,0:12:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来要回乔伊上次借的烤盘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I need that broiling pan that Joey borrowed the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次用来装小鸭吐出来的虫子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We used it when the duck was throwing up caterpillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉索诺玛牌  秋季刊第27页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Williams-Sonoma, fall catalog, page 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,4到6周后送货到家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Expect it in 4 to 6 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊今天一整天都不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, hey, umm, Joey's gonna be at the telethon for the rest of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整个家里就只有我们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have the whole place to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你想跟最佳情人  预约时间约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I just, thought maybe you'd want to book some time with "the best you've ever had."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  冠军先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what, champ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自愿放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公视电视募捐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}PBS Telethon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  我找到无私的善行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to let you know that I found a selfless good deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚去公园   让蜜峰叮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went down to the park and I let a bee sting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  这对谁有好处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What good is that going to do anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只蜜峰在同伴面前  脸上有光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It helps the bee look tough in front of his bee friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蜜峰很开心  我却很痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bee is happy, and I am definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蜜峰叮了你就死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, the bee probably died after he stung you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  30秒后开始录影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Back on in 30 seconds, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  可以跟你换位子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, would you mind switching with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别想  我刚好在镜头里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way. I'm in the shot, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你已经占这位子一整天了  我在接受捐款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on man! You've been here all day! I'm taking pledges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒数计时3  2...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we're on three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎收看电视募捐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Welcome back to our fall telethon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果各位喜欢《太阳马戏团》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now If you've been enjoying the performance of Cirque du Soleil...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以后还想收看同类型节目  方法很简单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you'd like to see more of the same kind of programming, it's very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要打电话捐款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All you have to do is call in and pledge...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并告诉我们的义工  阁下喜欢收看哪类型节目\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and at that time tell one of our volunteers what type of programming you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  我下不了决心  实在太难了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. I cannot make this decision. It is too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我决定交给命运之神\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm just going leave it entirely up to the gods of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神奇8号球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A Magic 8 Ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧  怎么可以用玩具决定命运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't be serious, you can't make this decision with a toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是玩具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, it's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what else to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是追回老婆  失去好朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I either keep my wife and lose one of my best friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是留下朋友  在30岁前离婚两次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or I keep my friend and get divorced for the second time before I'm 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有人有更好的建议  现在就说出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if anyone else has a better suggestion, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我真的没有办法  大家别害羞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I got nothing! Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各种建议都可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any suggestion will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神奇8号球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Magic 8 Ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是不该再见瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...should I never see Rachel again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"待会再问"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ask Again Later."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么答案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Later is not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"待会再问"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ask Again Later."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.66,0:16:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这东西坏掉了  不灵了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is broken! It is broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.59,0:16:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德今晚会跟女人上床吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will Chandler have sex tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"别太指望"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Don't Count On lt."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒觉得它很灵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seems like it works to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公视电视募款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}PBS Telethon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要捐钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like to make a pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想捐200元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would like to donate $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,200元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two hundred dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定  菲比  《芝麻街》可是伤你不浅啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure Pheebs? I mean, after what Sesame Street did to ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是很生气  不过我也知道很多妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still mad at them, but I also know that they bring happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没自杀的小孩很爱看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to lots of kids whose moms didn't kill themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了支持这节目  我决定做件好事  不过我自己可不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...by supporting them, I'm doing a good thing, but I'm not happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  这就是无私的善行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So there! A selfless good deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你捐钱没有一点开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you don't feel a little good about donating the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难过死了  我本想用那笔钱买只黄金鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it sucks. I was saving up to buy a hamster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:17:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄金鼠那种宠物  10元就买得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A hamster? Those things are, like, 10 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢的那只可没那么便宜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not the one I had my eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来今年的募款  已经超过去年总额\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It looks like we have surpassed last year's pledge total.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打破纪录的捐款是由  我们的义工募得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the pledge that did it was taken by one of our volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且这位还穿得很体面的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, boy! And may I say, one of our sharpest dressed volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位就是  乔伊崔比亚尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Joseph Tribbiani!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊上电视了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的捐款让乔伊上了电视  真是让我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My pledge got Joey on TV! That makes me feel so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我先前太得意了  不过有件事要告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...maybe I got carried away before, but there's something you gotta know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我表现得很好  也是因为你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I'm the best, it's only because you made me the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你在一起之前  我根本表现平平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was nothing before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以打去问我以前那些女友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call the other girls and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很快就问完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which wouldn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我跟你在一起时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But when I'm with you, and we're together...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想再跟我上床  我也能体谅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I understand if you never want to sleep with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过这决定就不对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that would be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们太厉害了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不上床实在太可惜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We owe it to sex!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if we owe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊什么时候回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When is Joey gonna be home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该不需要等他回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was kind of hoping we could do this without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  手套不用脱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no! Leave the gloves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我刚在清厕所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I just cleaned the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, why don't we lose the gloves? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让大家看看  谁才是高手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Let's show them how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不包括在内  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know that wasn't part of it? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  准备好没  我们要迟到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. You ready? We're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迟到什么  史黛拉啊  你没忘吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For what? For Stella, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有20多分钟就开演了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's getting her groove back in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全忘记了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I totally forgot about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意我爽约一次吧  我正在等艾蜜莉的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mind if I take a rain check? I'm waiting for a call from Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你不用去伦敦了  真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I hear you don't have to go to London. Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情没那么简单  我们还有很多问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not that easy. There's still a lot of relationship stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是一些问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉对我有些要求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, kind of what Emily wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以告诉我  或许我帮得上忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Why don't you talk to me about it? Maybe I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你帮不上忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, you can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  这件事你帮不上忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I kind of have to do this without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你自己办得到  但是如果你想找人谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you can do that too. I'm just saying if you need somebody to talk to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  无论艾蜜莉有何要求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, look, whatever this relationship stuff is that Emily wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你答应就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...just give it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的是你爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bottom line is that you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么要求  你就怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So just fix whatever she wants fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,答应就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总得试试看  不试试以后一定会后悔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're going to have to try. You'll just hate yourself if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快接电话啊  我都快被逼疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, answer it! It's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我有考虑过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look. Yes, I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的要求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about that thing you wanted me to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我办得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意来纽约吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So will you come to New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.52,0:21:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前没试过这招  我也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never done that before. Nope.
